1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,687
Minum air es...

2
00:00:01,687 --> 00:00:02,911
bikin gendut?

3
00:00:02,911 --> 00:00:04,321
Mitos...

4
00:00:04,321 --> 00:00:05,812
atau fakta?

5
00:00:06,986 --> 00:00:08,178
Jawabannya...

6
00:00:08,178 --> 00:00:09,196
MITOS!

7
00:00:09,196 --> 00:00:09,777
Air es itu

8
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:10,777
nol kalori!

9
00:00:10,777 --> 00:00:13,437
Tapi ada pelaku sebenarnya...

10
00:00:13,437 --> 00:00:14,539
di akhir video.

11
00:00:14,539 --> 00:00:15,277
Malah sebaliknya:

12
00:00:15,277 --> 00:00:17,634
air es suhunya sekitar empat derajat.

13
00:00:17,634 --> 00:00:19,763
Tubuh harus menghangatkannya

14
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:21,991
sampai tiga puluh tujuh derajat.

15
00:00:21,991 --> 00:00:23,001
Itu butuh energi:

16
00:00:23,001 --> 00:00:24,662
kira-kira enam belas kalori

17
00:00:24,662 --> 00:00:25,874
per setengah liter!

18
00:00:26,212 --> 00:00:28,891
Jadi, siapa pelakunya?

19
00:00:28,891 --> 00:00:29,641
GULA!

20
00:00:29,641 --> 00:00:31,291
Air es tawar: nol kalori.

21
00:00:31,291 --> 00:00:32,768
Es teh manis dua sendok gula:

22
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:34,333
sekitar seratus kalori!

23
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:36,012
Padahal batas gula sehari

24
00:00:36,012 --> 00:00:37,528
cuma empat sendok makan.

25
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:39,125
Jadi, minum air es?

26
00:00:39,125 --> 00:00:40,571
Aman, asal tawar!

27
00:00:40,571 --> 00:00:41,560
Kirim ke temanmu

28
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:44,066
yang masih takut minum es!

